ok 3 - a configuration whose supported set omits the source locale is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
ok 4 - a configuration whose supported set omits the default locale is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
ok 5 - a configuration whose chain does not end at the default root is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
ok 6 - a configuration that gives the default locale its own chain is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
ok 7 - a configuration that omits the chain of a non-default locale is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
ok 8 - a configuration with a chain that loops is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
ok 9 - a configuration with a non-canonical locale tag is refused and nothing is committed [P2-S09-AC-005]
